guage":"en-US","title":"Pita Hall","overview":"Kalender runs a small restaurant, inherited from his father. Ten years ago, after the death of his wife, he became increasingly withdrawn. He's averse to innovation and averse to taking risks, and his shop is struggling. The recent opening of a new-generation restaurant, Pidburger, only makes things worse. However, with the arrival of Öcü, a transformation begins, and they embark on numerous adventures to save the shop."},{"language":"tr-TR","overview":"Pide ustası Kalender, kızı Filiz ile beraber baba yadigarı küçük bir pide salonu işletmektedir. 10 yıl önce eşini kaybedince iyice içine kapanmıştır. Yeniliklere kapalı, risk almayan biridir ve dükkanı da zor durumdadır. Yakınlarda açılan yeni nesil pideci Pidburger işleri daha da kötüleştirir. Ancak Öcü’nün hayatına girmesiyle değişim başlar ve dükkanı kurtarmak için birçok maceraya atılırlar."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lMt5gV4IDCr1swycgmoQvUAhpgT.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lMt5gV4IDCr1swycgmoQvUAhpgT.png","language":"en","width":1867,"height":1080},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z2rDhL8ZHciR7q8FrbU7hPdZjoI.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z2rDhL8ZHciR7q8FrbU7hPdZjoI.png","language":"tr","width":1919,"height":688},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qeZIba40sbZ1g7LujKHQMbd1Qpw.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qeZIba40sbZ1g7LujKHQMbd1Qpw.png","language":"tr","width":1919,"height":688}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wJ8wb0b4v8msHcZKqSjOY3WECCZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wJ8wb0b4v8msHcZKqSjOY3WECCZ.jpg","language":"tr","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/byuD4E3Uoj3EoacpdohMonGQxba.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/byuD4E3Uoj3EoacpdohMonGQxba.jpg","language":"tr","width":840,"height